<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper B · Learner paper</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/b/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper B</p><h1>Paper B · Learner paper</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper B</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 20 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. What will the man do next?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 换猫的水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 交备用钥匙</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 准备猫粮</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. When does the teacher-led pet-care activity start?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午三点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午四点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午五点</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. How long does the speaker normally take the dog out each time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 四十分钟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两个小时</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 二十分钟</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. Which class can the woman try within her available time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 周二游泳课</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 周三游泳课</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 周三篮球课</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. What does Xiaoding’s preparation suggest he has learned?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 打球要记得带水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 球鞋完全不需要带</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 打完球也不会口渴</div></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. At which part of the sports centre will they meet?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 游泳馆里面</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 中心外的商店</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 篮球馆门口</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. Which means of transport do they choose?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 等公交车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 坐出租车</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 骑自行车</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. What is the first step after entering the west gate?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 向食堂左转</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 穿过小广场</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 去停车场</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. Which bus fits the man’s arrival and luggage needs?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六路车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十路车</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 两路车都来不及</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. What is the updated training arrangement?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 早上八点在学校球场</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午三点在学校球场</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 早上八点在体育馆</div></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. How many cartons of juice will they bring?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 两盒</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. Which mat will suit the woman’s group?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两人用的小号</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 只要蓝色小号</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 四人用的大号</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. How much must the student pay?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六块</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四块</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五块</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. Which bag meets both practical requirements?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 丙包</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 甲包</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乙包</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. What must the man do before going to play ball?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 把钥匙交给王阿姨</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 带着钥匙等到七点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 自己六点回家喂猫</div></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. How will the afternoon compare with the morning?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 更凉快</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一直有大风</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 热得多</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. Why has the match been moved to the evening?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午没有场地</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午太热</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 晚上门票更便宜</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. Which activity fits both of the stated limits?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 半小时跑步课</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 五十分钟投篮课</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 九十分钟游泳课</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What did the group do directly after watching the boats?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 听老师讲故事</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 学做香包</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 送礼物给弟弟</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What can we infer about Xiaofang by the end?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 她仍然完全不会做</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 她只想让老师代做</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 她对自己更有信心了</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 25 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. What should Xiaoning do after school?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">给小宁的留言<br>兔子的晚饭我已经放在盒子里，六点开盒子就可以。今天放学后，请你先把空水瓶装满。兔笼我早上已经打扫过了，不用再打扫，也不要另外买饲料。<br>爸爸</p></div><p class="note">兔笼: rabbit cage</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 重新打扫兔笼</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 给水瓶装水</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 去买饲料</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. When does the explanatory talk begin?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">课后宠物小组<br>周五三点半开门，四点开始讲解。四点半大家练习怎样给猫梳毛，五点离开。第一次来的同学请三点四十前到，先登记姓名，不要把到场时间当成讲解开始时间。</p></div><p class="note">梳毛: brush fur</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午三点四十</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午四点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午四点</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. How long is each outing with the dog?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">照顾小狗的约定<br>这个星期，小安每天放学后带小狗出去十五分钟，回来再准备自己的晚饭。星期三虽然放学晚，也照常出去十五分钟。周末改由哥哥照顾，但每次时间仍然一样。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三十分钟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一小时</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十五分钟</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Which class matches Xiao’an’s day and learning goal?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小安的选课卡<br>本周只有周一下午能参加活动，想学球类运动。运动中心周一有羽毛球课、周二有篮球课，周一另有绘画课。三种课都不需要以前学过，费用也都一样。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 周二篮球课</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 周一绘画课</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 周一羽毛球课</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Which preparation is supported by Xiaoning’s record?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">运动后的记录<br>以前小宁一打完球就赶着回家，书包里也总忘放水。昨天教练提醒他带水，并在结束后坐一会儿。他照着做了，回家路上说比以前轻松，打算下次也提前准备。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 带水并留一点休息时间</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 结束后马上跑回家</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把水留在家里</div></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Where should the group meet?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">集合消息<br>运动中心里有游泳馆、篮球馆和网球场。本周小组的球拍课在网球场，大家直接在那里集合，不用先去售票处等。游泳馆今天只对学校开放，篮球馆下午有比赛。</p></div><p class="note">售票处: ticket office</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 网球场</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 游泳馆</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 售票处</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. How is the group asked to travel?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小组交通约定<br>教练会用小巴接大家到运动中心，车上可以放球拍。请九点在学校南门等，不用自己骑车。我们到了中心还要一起检查器材，所以先别一个人提前过去。</p></div><p class="note">器材: equipment</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 各自骑车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 各自提前坐地铁</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乘教练的小巴</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. What should visitors pass first after entering?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">运动中心入口图说明<br>由北门进入后，先经过小花园，到服务台领取活动卡，再按蓝色箭头上二楼。练习馆就在楼梯右边。没有活动卡不能进馆，请不要进门就直接上楼。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二楼练习馆</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 小花园</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 楼梯右侧</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Which entrance lets Xiaohe enter before the stated deadline?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">运动中心入口卡<br>东门九点开放，从车站步行十五分钟。西门十点开放，从车站步行五分钟。小何九点下车，要在九点半前进场。进门以后到教室的路程一样，他不能等到十点。</p></div><p class="note">步行: on foot</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 西门</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 东门</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 两个门都来不及</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. What will the group now do at two in the afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">运动中心活动更新<br>周六下午太热，原定两点在室外参观球场的活动取消，改看一楼展厅里的运动照片展。开始时间仍是下午两点，不需要去游泳馆集合。请把这条新消息告诉其他同学。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 在室外参观球场</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 在一楼展厅看照片展</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 在游泳馆集合</div></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. How many cartons of juice are listed?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">野餐装箱单<br>果汁五盒，牛奶两盒，面包三袋。小林带果汁，小陈带面包，老师带牛奶。名单上有五位同学，每个人可以拿一盒果汁；牛奶是留给另外两位帮忙的家长的。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五盒</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which size should the group choose?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">用品卡<br>小号垫：两个人坐，收起来放进书包。<br>大号垫：四个人坐，需要单独拿。<br>这次四位同学只有一张垫子的预算，大家都想坐在垫子上，不能再借别人的垫子。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两人坐的小号</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四人坐的大号</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 两张小号</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. Which amount is the non-refundable one-day usage fee?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">野餐篮租用单<br>一天使用费十元，另交押金二十元。小何先付三十元，店员说明：按时还回完整的篮子，就退二十元押金；十元使用费不退。小何打算当天傍晚按时归还。</p></div><p class="note">押金: refundable deposit</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 二十元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三十元</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. Which package fits the facilities described in the note?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">野餐准备<br>公园没有厨房，也没有冰箱。甲套餐是需要加热的生饺子；乙套餐是面包和洗好的苹果，不用加热也不用冷藏；丙套餐要一直冷藏。小组要在公园待三小时，只能带一套。</p></div><p class="note">冷藏: keep refrigerated</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲套餐</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 丙套餐</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乙套餐</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. What has Xiao’an agreed to do immediately after class?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">家庭群消息<br>妈妈今天五点到家，小安四点半下课，哥哥六点回来。小狗五点以前要有人接回家。妈妈说自己赶不上，小安答应放学直接去接，哥哥回来以后再带狗出去走走。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 接小狗回家</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 等哥哥六点回来</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 先回家等妈妈</div></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. How is the afternoon expected to compare with early morning?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">周日天气表<br>早晨二十三度，微风；下午三十六度，无风；晚上二十七度。运动中心提醒：下午来上课请带水，不要把早晨的凉快当成全天的天气，室外活动尽量避开午后。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 更热，而且没有风</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 更凉快，风更大</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 温度完全一样</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. Why is the lesson now in the morning?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">课程群消息<br>周二篮球课本来四点开始，现改为上午九点。球场没有比赛，也没有维修。老师说下午太热，希望大家在太阳还不强的时候练习。报名和上课地点都不用改变。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 球场下午有比赛</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 球场需要维修</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 避开下午的高温</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which plan follows the coach’s practice-and-rest requirement?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">训练安排卡<br>教练要求小林每练习二十分钟，至少休息五分钟再继续。<br>甲：连续练四十分钟。乙：练二十分钟，休息五分钟，再练二十分钟。丙：练二十分钟，休息一分钟，再继续练。小林要选符合要求的安排。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 乙</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 丙</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What must visitors do just after collecting the activity card?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">端午活动须知<br>进门先领取活动卡，再到服务桌盖章。拿到盖章的卡才可以换一份手工材料。完成香包后可以在出口拍照。没有盖章不能领材料，请不要直接到出口排队。</p></div><p class="note">盖章: stamp</p><p class="note">香包: sachet</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 直接领取手工材料</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 到服务桌盖章</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 去出口拍照</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. What does Xiaohe’s later behaviour suggest?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小何的端午活动记录<br>我第一次来，找不到做香包的教室，工作人员带我过去。活动结束后，我看见新来的同学也在找教室，就陪他走过去，还留在门口给后面的人指路，直到大家都进了教室。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 他愿意帮助不熟悉活动的人</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 他只想早点独自离开</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 他一直没有找到教室</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 20 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 20 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to a sports schedule conflict</h2><p>Reply to Xiaoyu in Chinese. Answer whether you can attend the new badminton session on Tuesday at five and say whether you can bring a racket. Give one reason connected to your availability or equipment. Suggest a workable alternative or ask a relevant question. Invent details if needed. About 40-60 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小何：周三的羽毛球课取消了，小组想改到周二下午五点。你能参加吗？你能带球拍来吗？如果不方便，我们再想别的办法。<br>小雨</p></div><ul><li>Answer whether Tuesday at five works for you.</li><li>Say whether you can bring a racket.</li><li>Give a reason related to availability or equipment.</li><li>Suggest a feasible alternative or ask a relevant question.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Tell a classmate about a short trip</h2><p>Use the fictional trip card to describe last Sunday in Chinese. Include when and where the trip happened, at least two actions in a consistent order, and a feeling or reason. You may add plausible details. About 80-120 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">时间：上周日<br>地点：城外的小湖<br>早上：全班坐小巴出发<br>到达后：老师带大家沿湖看鸟<br>中午：在树下吃自带的午饭<br>下午：整理垃圾，再坐车返校<br>感受：自己选择并说明</p></div><ul><li>Identify last Sunday.</li><li>Identify the lake outside town.</li><li>Describe one action on the card.</li><li>Describe a second action in a consistent sequence.</li><li>Give a feeling or a reason.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Arrange a sports-centre visit</h2><p>A classmate is arranging a visit to the sports centre. Answer four fixed recorded prompts in Chinese. Each prompt plays twice, followed by 15 seconds to prepare and up to 25 seconds to record. Use real or invented details. Four responses are reviewed together as one task out of eight; these prompts are not adaptive.</p><p>Discuss equipment needs, choose an activity, explain your choice, and handle a changed meeting point.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Compare two short trips</h2><p>Recommend one of the two short trips to a classmate who must be back at school by three on Sunday and has forty yuan. Compare the options, state a choice, give two reasons supported by the cards and explain a short plan. If you choose an option with a difficulty, explain how you would manage it. Prepare for 60 seconds and speak for up to 90 seconds.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">周日短途选择<br>甲：学校组织的小湖活动，上午九点出发、下午两点回校，三十五元含往返车费，需要自带午饭。<br>乙：邻城公园，上午十点出发、下午四点回校，二十元含往返车费和午饭；可以提前离开，但提前返程的车费另算，金额未知。<br>同学：下午三点前必须回校，预算四十元，家中已准备好可带走的午饭。</p></div><ul><li>Compare one or more features of both trips.</li><li>Choose a trip.</li><li>Give a first supported reason.</li><li>Give a second supported reason.</li><li>Describe a feasible short plan, including how to handle any chosen constraint.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section></main></body></html>